        ('在莫高窟可以拍照吗？', 'Can I take pictures in Mogao Grottoes?', 'To protect the murals and sculptures, photography and filming are usually prohibited inside the caves. Please obey the instructors and on-site signs, and comply with management regulations in areas where outdoor shooting is allowed.'),
        ('敦煌有哪些特色美食？', 'What are the special delicacies in Dunhuang?', 'Common specialties include donkey meat yellow noodles, mutton braised pancakes, Dunhuang stuffed skin, apricot skin water and various mutton dishes. You can choose regular restaurants to taste according to your eating habits.'),
